            <note corresp="#d186-f3" n="3" xml:id="d186-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram 1949 from Buenos Aires, June 11, contained a summary of Beaulac’s
                    conversation with Frondizi on June 10 (see <ref target="#d185"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">supra</hi></ref>). (Department of State, Central
                    Files, 835.10/6–1159)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d186-f4" n="4" xml:id="d186-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d181-f7">footnote 7, Document 181</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d186-f5" n="5" xml:id="d186-f5-content">
                <p>No record of this conversation has been found in Department of State files.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
